<title>USA: Bridger 550 MW Wyo. unit seen down Wed for work.</title>
<headline>Bridger 550 MW Wyo. unit seen down Wed for work.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 550 megawatt (MW) unit 4 at the Jim Bridger coal-fired power plant in Wyoming was expected to shut Wednesday for extended maintenance work through mid-April, market sources said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Bridger plant's other three 550 MW units were expected to continue operating at normal rates.</p>
<p>The Bridger plant is owned by PacifiCorp and Idaho Power, but official confirmation of its status was not available.</p>
<p>--Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761</p>
</text>
